<title>USA: SOCCER-UNITED STATES BEAT TRINIDAD 2-0. [CORRECTED 23:09 GMT]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UNITED STATES BEAT TRINIDAD 2-0. [CORRECTED 23:09 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Virginia 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States</p>
<p>took sole possession of first place in its World Cup CONCACAF</p>
<p>qualifying group, defeating Trinidad &amp; Tobago 2-0 on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Thomas Dooley (52nd minute), Eric Wynalda</p>
<p>(84th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,312</p>
